/-!
# Source occurrence of actual health cessation

The source is the exact macro next generated by mandate succession, including
its translated entry and temporal authority.  A canonical depth+3
Constitution Payment is presented into the UBI restriction at that visit.  The
outer health channel is consumed only as the dependent relation/service face
of the same canonical Payment; its empty local ledger is never used as action
authority.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

